# Personal Portfolio

- Focus: Front-End Web Developer (pangunahing focus: React landing pages, UI craft, responsive, performance, accessibility; pangalawa: web systems at manual QA)
- Stack: Vite + React 18 (function components + hooks, JavaScript lang) + Tailwind CSS
- Animations: `motion` (`motion/react`), reusable constants sa `src/lib/motion.js`
- Icons: `lucide-react` para sa UI icons, `simple-icons` (inline SVG, `currentColor`) para sa tech logos
- Theme: strictly black & white (dark `#0a0a0a`, light `#f4f4f2`) na may subtle SVG grain texture at hairlines
- Fonts: Space Grotesk (headings), Inter (body), JetBrains Mono (labels/metadata), Instrument Serif italic (editorial accents)
- Navigation: Fixed left sidebar sa desktop (`lg+`), top bar + accessible drawer sa mobile/tablet
- Sections: Home, About, Stack, Work, Experience & Education, GitHub Activity, Contact, Footer
- Content: Lahat nasa `src/config.js` at `src/data/` na may `// EDIT ME` markers; hindi hardcoded sa components
- Accessibility & QA: Igalang ang `prefers-reduced-motion`, dark/light mode, WCAG AA contrast, keyboard navigation, at 375px/768px/1280px viewports
- Testing: Vitest (`npm run test:unit`) at Playwright + axe-core (`npm run test:e2e`)

## Git
- Diretso sa `main`, walang branches
- Commit message: isang linya, hindi lalampas sa 60 characters, walang body
- Format: `feat:`, `fix:`, `refactor:`, `style:`, `docs:`, `chore:`, `test:`
- Huwag i-commit ang personal info (phone, full address, ID numbers), `.env`, `dist/`, `screenshots/`, o test reports
